**Segmentation:** `build_visual_alignment` (`4144`) builds `anchor_bounds = anchors + synthetic end` (`4160-4167`); slices `docx_segment` / `pdf_segment` between anchor indices (`4173-4174`); runs `align_monotonic_segment` per segment (`4176-4186`); emits fixed `pair_kind=anchor` pairs at boundaries (`4214-4228`).

**Tiers:** Unique printed labels treated as high-confidence locks (`3684-3712`); visual/mathtype anchors gated by thresholds and non-crossing selection; not a single numeric confidence field on all anchors.

