## 6 � Assignment

- **Algorithm:** Monotone DP with three moves (skip docx, skip pdf, align) per segment � `align_monotonic_segment` (`3903-3970`).
- **Band:** `_alignment_state_allowed` (`3850-3854`): `expected_j = round(i * pdf_count / docx_count)`, require `|j - expected_j| <= band_width`. Band width `_alignment_band_width` (`3840-3847`): `WIDE_ALIGNMENT_BAND=24` if segment_index==1 or segment len>30, else `DEFAULT_ALIGNMENT_BAND=12` (`70-71`). If DP infeasible, band widened to `max(docx_count, pdf_count)` (`3979-3981`).
- **Unmapped:** Backtrace produces `pair_kind` `docx_only` / `pdf_only` (`4019+`, `_make_docx_only_pair`).
- **Post-DP repair order** (in `compare_raw_docx_to_tagged_pdf`, each often followed by `drop_pdf_only_pairs_for_claimed_orders`): `refine_aligned_pairs_local_swaps` (`11781`); `merge_docx_fixed_comparison_pairs` (`11784`); `apply_leftover_context_matches` (`11789`, `11795`, `11803`, `11886`, `11907`); `apply_ieq_table_block_alignment` (`11790`); `apply_dl_ontology_ieq_alignment` (`11793`, `11876`); `apply_ieq_gap_interpolation` (`11796`, `11920`); `apply_ieq_run_alignment` (`11797`); `apply_ieq_contiguous_block_alignment` (`11798`); `apply_display_inline_context_rescue` (`11815`); `apply_ieq_permuted_block_alignment` (`11822`, `11897`); `apply_ieq_row_group_monotonic_alignment` (`11834`); `unbind_non_monotonic_untrusted_pairs` (`11836`); `unbind_far_ieq_run_pairs` (`11840`); `apply_leftover_monotonic_visual_rescue` (`11844`); `apply_mathtype_untagged_drawing_matches` (`11852`); `fill_unpaired_in_reading_order` (multiple); `apply_unbind_weak_far_fragile_matches` (`11864`); `apply_dl_ontology_preamble_ieq_alignment` (`11877`); `unbind_zero_prose_owners_for_better_leftover` (`11882`, `11903`); `apply_ieq_prefix_hole_rebind` (`11922`); 599/1143/12483 conditional blocks (`11931-12061`); `pair_numbered_display_leading_fragments` (`12054`); `assign_final_pair_orders` (`12062`); flag passes `_flag_*` (`12063-12069`).

